{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>DumbLevel 是一款為掛畫、安裝層架而設的 iPhone 水平儀應用，適合自行佈置家居、需要精準對位的用家。程式讀數精確至 0.1 度，並內置掛畫規劃器，直接計算並列出標記位置。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-62.webp\">\n<h2>多軸水平儀結合掛畫計算</h2>\n<p>DumbLevel 按手機擺放方向自動切換水平、垂直與雙軸氣泡模式，讀數精確至 0.1 度，並以顏色及文字指出哪一端偏高。長按可凍結讀數，提示音隨接近水平而加快。內置校正以兩次反向量度抵銷感應器偏差。掛畫規劃器按相框、層架、窗簾桿等項目計算位置，直接列出離牆邊的吋數標記，並可輸出 PDF 或翻查過往工程紀錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-308-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-309-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-310-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-311-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-312-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-313-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：DumbLevel</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T03:04:50.299489+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:36:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T04:58:33.998359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T02:58:58.725303+00:00","content_hash":"990709e45153adface367067f625aa08b2da32e1373addf74e8f32667f1a0b32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}